{"id":518,"title":"解答: 寻找峰值元素","summary":"详细讨论了峰值元素挑战的参考解法。","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"cca7a841-b4f7-4ddb-8815-5b26edffab34","text":"## 解法1\n\n最直观的思路，线性遍历比较:","text_html":"<h2>解法1</h2>\n<p>最直观的思路，线性遍历比较:</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"TabbedCode","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b7a6d283-0af5-40b5-831c-dfaf020dc6b7","caption":"","code_contents":[{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"tab_code_0_b7a6d283-0af5-40b5-831c-dfaf020dc6b7","title":"Find_Peak_Element","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"# Function to find the peak element in the list\ndef find_peak(lst):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds a peak element\n    :param lst: List of integers\n    :return: Returns a peak element in a given list\n    \"\"\"\n\n    # If the list in empty\n    if len(lst) is 0:\n        return -1\n    \n    # If the list has only one element\n    if len(lst) is 1:\n        return lst[0]\n\n    for i in range(1, len(lst) -1):\n        if lst[i] >= lst[i-1] and lst[i] >= lst[i+1]:\n            return lst[i]\n\n    if lst[0] >= lst[1]:\n        return lst[0]\n    elif lst[len(lst) - 1] >= lst[len(lst) - 2]:\n        return lst[len(lst) - 1]\n\n    return -1\n\n# Driver code to test above function\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n\n    # Example: 1\n    lst = [7, 11, 22, 13, 4, 0]\n    print('One peak point is: ', find_peak(lst))\n\n    # Example: 2\n    lst = [0, 3, 100, 2, -1, 0]\n    print('One peak point is: ', find_peak(lst))\n\n    # Example: 3\n    lst = [6, 5, 4, 3, 2, 1]\n    print('One peak point is: ', find_peak(lst))\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null}],"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"6fef072f-d96f-480d-99f1-e22a68d815c0","text":"### 解释\n\n1. 从头开始，将每个元素与它的邻居进行比较\n\n2. 无论你在列表中找到什么，都要返回峰值元素","text_html":"<h3>解释</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>从头开始，将每个元素与它的邻居进行比较</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>无论你在列表中找到什么，都要返回峰值元素</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":2},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"51796b8f-00ae-4a63-99d8-bdbc740a03c8","text":"如果列表是以递增的顺序排序的，没有重复，那么最后一个元素总是一个峰值元素：","text_html":"<p>如果列表是以递增的顺序排序的，没有重复，那么最后一个元素总是一个峰值元素：</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":3},{"type":"CanvasAnimation","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f865168c-0a89-4ca9-afec-105d0114e732","width":600,"height":200,"canvas_objects":[{"caption":"","width":600,"height":200,"canvas_json":"{\"version\":\"3.6.6\",\"objects\":[{\"type\":\"group\",\"version\":\"3.6.6\",\"originX\":\"left\",\"originY\":\"top\",\"left\":154.83,\"top\":39.17,\"width\":289.33,\"height\":50.67,\"fill\":\"\",\"stroke\":null,\"strokeWidth\":1,\"strokeDashArray\":null,\"strokeLineCap\":\"butt\",\"strokeDashOffset\":0,\"strokeLineJoin\":\"miter\",\"strokeMiterLimit\":10,\"scaleX\":1,\"scaleY\":1,\"angle\":0,\"flipX\":false,\"flipY\":false,\"opacity\":1,\"shadow\":null,\"visible\":true,\"clipTo\":null,\"backgroundColor\":\"\",\"fillRule\":\"nonzero\",\"paintFirst\":\"fill\",\"globalCompositeOperation\":\"source-over\",\"transformMatrix\":null,\"skewX\":0,\"skewY\":0,\"objects\":[{\"type\":\"polygon\",\"version\":\"3.6.6\",\"originX\":\"left\",\"originY\":\"top\",\"left\":-139.67,\"top\":-19.67,\"width\":29,\"height\":29,\"fill\":\"#e13a55\",\"stroke\":\"#000000\",\"strokeWidth\":0.5,\"strokeDashArray\":null,\"strokeLineCap\":\"butt\",\"strokeDashOffset\":0,\"strokeLineJoin\":\"miter\",\"strokeMiterLimit\":10,\"scaleX\":1.33,\"scaleY\":1.33,\"angle\":0,\"flipX\":false,\"flipY\":false,\"opacity\":1,\"shadow\":null,\"visible\":true,\"clipTo\"